msgid "A component required by the Magnolienbaum is missing."
msgstr "Komponenta, kotruž Magnolienbaum trjeba, faluje."

msgid ""
"A fallback for branch baum-1: when the direct connection cannot be reached, "
"messages travel through a WebDAV folder on your Nextcloud server."
msgstr ""
"Rezerwowa puć za hałuzu baum-1: hdyž direktne zwiskowanje njeje docpějomne, "
"du powěsće přez rjadowak WebDAV na wašim serwerje Nextcloud."

msgid "A group with this name already exists."
msgstr "Skupina z tutym mjenom hižo eksistuje."

msgid "A maximum of 10 SMS parts is allowed."
msgstr "Najwjace 10 SMS-dźělow je dowolene."

msgid "A notebook with this name already exists in this group."
msgstr "Noticowy zešiwk z tutym mjenom hižo w tutej skupinje eksistuje."

msgid ""
"A numeric code can be entered conveniently using the keypad when opening; "
"letters work as well. After three failed attempts, the organizer waits five "
"minutes."
msgstr ""
"Ličbowy kod da so při wočinjenju komfortabelnje z numeriskej tastaturu "
"zapodać; pismiki tež funguja. Po třoch njewuspěšnych pospytach čaka "
"Organizator pjeć mjeńšin."

msgid "A one-time import adds contacts only after your selection."
msgstr "Jónkróćny import kontakty hakle po wašim wuběru přida."

msgid ""
"A pairing file works like a one-time key. Give it only to the person whose "
"Organizer you want to connect; it expires after 15 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Porowanski dataj funguje kaž jónkróćny kluč. Dajće ju jenož wosobje, z "
"kotrejž Organizatorom chceće zwjazk zestajić; po 15 mjeńšinach spadnje."

msgid ""
"A password initially locks out the background reminder service. Without the "
"explicit permission below, notifications work only while the organizer is "
"open and unlocked."
msgstr ""
"Hesło najprjedy zawrě słužbu dopominanjow w pozadku. Bjez wurazneho "
"dowolenja deleka funguja zdźělenki jenož, hdyž je Organizator wočinjeny a "
"wotzamknjeny."

msgid "A personal synchronization attachment hash is invalid or duplicated."
msgstr "Haš přiwěška wosobinskeje synchronizacije je njepłaćiwy abo dwójny."

msgid "A personal synchronization attachment source is not an object."
msgstr "Žórło přiwěška wosobinskeje synchronizacije objekt njeje."

msgid "A personal synchronization batch is not an object."
msgstr "Pakćik wosobinskeje synchronizacije objekt njeje."

msgid "A phone is already paired or pairing. Finish that connection first."
msgstr ""
"Telefon je hižo skoplowany abo so runje skopluje. Skónčće najprjedy tutón "
"zwisk."

msgid ""
"A separate encrypted connection for dial requests, device status and "
"selected notifications."
msgstr ""
"Wosebity zaklučowany zwisk za wólenske naprašowanja, status aparata a "
"wubrane zdźělenki."

