"The button in the bottom bar opens the selection for the section you have "
"open. From there the ticked entries can be printed, exported or moved to the "
"wastebasket."
msgstr ""
"Tłóčatko w delnim pasu wočini wuběr za wočinjeny wotrězk. Wottam hodźa so "
"wotškrtnjene zapiski ćišćeć, eksportować abo do papjeroweho koša přesunyć."

