"The folder may be locally synchronized by Nextcloud, Google Drive, Dropbox, "
"or OneDrive. Magnolie does not sign in to a provider. Automatic backups run "
"only while Organizer is open and unlocked, immediately after data was saved "
"successfully."
msgstr ""
"Rjadowak hodźi so lokalnje přez Nextcloud, Google Drive, Dropbox abo "
"OneDrive synchronizować. Magnolie so pola poskićowarja njepřizjewja. "
"Awtomatiske zawěsćenja běža jenož, dokelž je Organizer wočinjeny a "
"wotamknjeny, hnydom po wuspěšnym składowanju datow."

msgid ""
"The helper frame marks the control that currently has keyboard focus. This "
"makes it easier to operate the Organizer with Tab, arrow keys, Enter and "
"Space. Ctrl+Alt+H switches the frame on or off at any time."
msgstr ""
"Pomocny wobłuk markěruje wodźidło, kotrež ma runje tastaturowy fokus. To "
"wolóži wobchadźenje Organizatora z Tab, šipkami, Enter a prózdnotastej. "
"Ctrl+Alt+H wobłuk kóždy čas zaswěći abo zhasnje."

